WEBVTT

00:38:58.070 --> 00:39:00.210
And then she got sick,
and then it was like,

00:39:00.234 --> 00:39:02.979
there's no way I'm not letting
her know what she is to me.

00:39:03.003 --> 00:39:05.062
CA: So it was because of the diagnosis --

00:39:05.086 --> 00:39:06.239
EG: Absolutely.

00:39:06.263 --> 00:39:09.470
CA: ... that you decided you had
to make this a public relationship.

00:39:09.494 --> 00:39:13.363
EG: There was a vision I had in my head,
and it was the scariest thing I ever saw.

00:39:13.387 --> 00:39:16.692
It was me sitting in a hospital room
holding her hand while she died

00:39:16.716 --> 00:39:19.660
and her never knowing
that she was the love of my life.

00:39:19.684 --> 00:39:21.339
I couldn't do it.

00:39:21.363 --> 00:39:25.543
I just couldn't do it, not for any vow,
not for any reason could I do it,

00:39:25.567 --> 00:39:27.793
and so I just had to tell the truth.

00:39:27.817 --> 00:39:30.105
And she was in love with me, too.